---
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout title="About — Duane Moore" description="About Duane Moore.">
  <Section title="About" intro="A builder's bio, not a corporate hostage note.">
    <div class="stack">
      <p>
        Duane Moore is an engineer, architect, founder, and systems thinker with experience spanning startups,
        consulting, mobile platforms, backend systems, AI workflows, and high-availability transaction infrastructure.
      </p>
      <p>
        He has led engineering organizations, built products across iOS, Android, web, and backend systems, and spent
        a good chunk of his career translating ambitious ideas into working software under real-world constraints.
      </p>
      <p>
        His work has included product and engineering leadership at Atlas and Channel19, consulting through Zarkov
        Technologies, payments and platform leadership at Clover, and large-scale systems architecture at Intelligent
        Software Solutions.
      </p>
      <p>
        He writes about software, tools, AI, systems design, and the occasional technological absurdity. These days,
        his main public outposts are this site, Substack, and <a href="https://x.com/Duane1024">@Duane1024</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .stack {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .stack p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 1.03rem;
  }
</style>
